Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.18,0:00:09.22,Default,,0,0,0,,The Princess Sapphire\NKnight of the Ribbon
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.00,0:00:50.16,Default,,0,0,0,,♪ Atashi no miru yume himitsu nano ♪\NThe dreams I see are my secret
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.25,0:00:57.09,Default,,0,0,0,,♪ Dare ni mo iwanai himitsu nano ♪\NI won’t tell anyone—it’s my secret
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.54,0:01:02.46,Default,,0,0,0,,♪ Akai manto hira hira ♪\NA red cape fluttering
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.46,0:01:04.98,Default,,0,0,0,,♪ Uma o tobasu oujo ♪\NGalloping on a horse—the princess
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.98,0:01:06.90,Default,,0,0,0,,♪ Sore ga atashi ♪\NThat’s me!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.62,0:01:10.90,Default,,0,0,0,,♪ Lula-dula-lula-dula ♪\N-
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.91,0:01:13.42,Default,,0,0,0,,♪ Lulu laa, lulaa ♪\N-
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.54,0:01:18.02,Default,,0,0,0,,♪ Lula-dula-lula-dula ♪\N-
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.14,0:01:20.74,Default,,0,0,0,,♪ Lulu laa, lulaa ♪\N-
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.50,0:01:25.22,Default,,0,0,0,,♪ Ribon no kishi wa ♪\NThe Knight of the Ribbon,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.22,0:01:28.62,Default,,0,0,0,,♪ Honto wa hontto wa ♪\NTruly, truly,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.62,0:01:31.82,Default,,0,0,0,,♪ Atashi nano sa ♪\NIt’s really me!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.10,0:01:50.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Fiftieth Episode\NThe Fortune Teller\NBlack Knight of Babel Castle
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.19,0:02:09.00,Default,,0,0,0,,What is that?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.28,0:02:10.28,Default,,0,0,0,,What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.79,0:02:19.86,Default,,0,0,0,,I've never seen this place before...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.88,0:02:21.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait, when did the lights go out?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.82,0:02:23.93,Default,,0,0,0,,What on earth is happening?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.11,0:02:49.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Forgive me.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.06,0:02:52.63,Default,,0,0,0,,I've identified that tower.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.66,0:02:56.08,Default,,0,0,0,,It's a massive castle the X-Union is building within Goldland territory.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.95,0:02:58.87,Default,,0,0,0,,What? X-Union?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.63,0:03:01.34,Default,,0,0,0,,X-Union, you say...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.12,0:03:07.93,Default,,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.40,0:03:10.22,Default,,0,0,0,,X intends to use that castle as a foothold
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.24,0:03:12.06,Default,,0,0,0,,to invade Silverland.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.23,0:03:13.82,Default,,0,0,0,,They're planning to attack us out of nowhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.62,0:03:17.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Is the castle finished already?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.56,0:03:18.96,Default,,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.98,0:03:22.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Even for X, it's a massive undertaking, so progress seems slow.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.72,0:03:25.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Whether that castle is built first
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.41,0:03:27.61,Default,,0,0,0,,or we fortify our defenses first—
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.64,0:03:30.04,Default,,0,0,0,,the very fate of Silverland rests on this race.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.09,0:03:58.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Curse the X-Union! I'll never surrender Silverland to them!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.32,0:04:20.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Look at those fools in Silverland, panicking.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.93,0:04:26.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Struggle all you want, but once this castle is finished, you're done for.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.88,0:04:28.02,Default,,0,0,0,,When will construction be completed?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.65,0:04:30.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, um...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.15,0:04:32.83,Default,,0,0,0,,As you can see, we are hurrying, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.88,0:04:46.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Do it right!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.31,0:04:49.36,Default,,0,0,0,,I asked when it will end!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.21,0:04:51.39,Default,,0,0,0,,My apologies.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.71,0:04:55.18,Default,,0,0,0,,We're falling behind because we don't have enough slaves...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.21,0:04:56.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Short-handed?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.09,0:04:58.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Then get more slaves!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.86,0:05:01.90,Default,,0,0,0,,But we've already used all the slaves from Goldland.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.88,0:05:04.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Who said anything about Goldland?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.06,0:05:12.82,Default,,0,0,0,,I can see them! Those Silverland fools!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.36,0:05:17.20,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll kidnap them and build a stronghold to destroy Silverland.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.32,0:05:21.44,Default,,0,0,0,,That's how X operates.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.11,0:05:25.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Go, to Silverland!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.02,0:05:50.60,Default,,0,0,0,,What is this black fog?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.82,0:06:12.62,Default,,0,0,0,,What? Someone else was taken?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.22,0:06:18.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes. A total of 49 people have been swallowed by that mysterious fog.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.58,0:06:21.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Do we still not know what the fog really is?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.06,0:06:26.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, rumor has it that inside the fog lurks a phantom giant in iron armor...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.19,0:06:28.19,Default,,0,0,0,,A phantom giant?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.95,0:06:37.27,Default,,0,0,0,,They say the Phantom Giant is a demon messenger from X's Babel outpost.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.26,0:06:40.38,Default,,0,0,0,,The fog attacks Silverland at night,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.41,0:06:43.80,Default,,0,0,0,,and they say everyone in this town will be devoured by demons.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.92,0:06:50.40,Default,,0,0,0,,That's ridiculous!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.84,0:06:54.54,Default,,0,0,0,,No, it's true! I heard it from a guy who was chased by the fog.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.92,0:07:00.26,Default,,0,0,0,,They say a giant in black armor rides across the sky on an ink-black horse.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.00,0:07:11.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Who's there?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.75,0:07:18.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Allow me to read your fortunes. Let me read them for you!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.46,0:07:22.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, I don't believe in fortune-telling. Get lost!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.18,0:07:31.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Take heed. A mark of ill omen shadows your faces.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.89,0:07:37.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Before long, you shall see a mist darker than night.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.39,0:07:38.74,Default,,0,0,0,,That's enough! Shut up!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.81,0:07:51.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't panic. Cry or scream all you want, my fortunes have never failed.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.12,0:08:00.25,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't wanna see any dark mist!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.88,0:08:08.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Tink, are you going home already?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.48,0:08:11.40,Default,,0,0,0,,What if the Phantom Giant really appears?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.60,0:08:13.06,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you going to do, Sapphire?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.65,0:08:17.78,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll fight. That's why I'm out here on patrol.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.35,0:08:19.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Then I'm fighting too!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.90,0:08:23.80,Default,,0,0,0,,No way! A kid like you needs to go straight home!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.08,0:08:26.82,Default,,0,0,0,,That's ridiculous! You're a kid too, Sapphire!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.71,0:08:29.74,Default,,0,0,0,,There's something black under the bridge right now!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.80,0:08:32.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh? Where? Alright, I'll go check!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.34,0:08:36.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Away!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.74,0:08:39.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey! You fraud! Wait for me!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.90,0:08:44.68,Default,,0,0,0,,You meanie! Liar!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.71,0:08:46.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Why couldn't you take me along?!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.92,0:09:07.18,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm scared!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.14,0:09:35.21,Default,,0,0,0,,W-W-What are you?! I-I'm not scared of you!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.15,0:09:44.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Help me!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.16,0:09:49.18,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm scared!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.35,0:09:50.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Ghost!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.36,0:09:52.14,Default,,0,0,0,,What is with that kid?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.16,0:09:53.16,Default,,0,0,0,,What a weird kid!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.04,0:10:20.18,Default,,0,0,0,,That's the cat that was with the fortune teller earlier.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.28,0:10:21.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Get lost!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.00,0:10:22.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Shoo!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.72,0:10:28.71,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm scared, you guys! The fortune came true!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.99,0:10:30.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Help me!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.65,0:10:41.96,Default,,0,0,0,,I hear something! That's my daughter's voice!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.40,0:10:44.21,Default,,0,0,0,,What is it? What is it? What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.12,0:10:58.84,Default,,0,0,0,,What is it?!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.87,0:11:01.07,Default,,0,0,0,,It's the Phantom Giant!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.28,0:11:10.01,Default,,0,0,0,,What's that?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.32,0:11:16.10,Default,,0,0,0,,There you are, giant knight!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.99,0:11:19.18,Default,,0,0,0,,So this is the black mist?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.21,0:11:22.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Where are you, Phantom Giant?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.23,0:11:25.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Show yourself, Phantom Giant!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.09,0:11:28.06,Default,,0,0,0,,You wait here, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.25,0:11:32.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Show yourself, Phantom Giant!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.10,0:11:34.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Sapphire will take you on!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.68,0:11:44.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Explain yourself!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.16,0:11:49.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Why are you kidnapping the men of Silverland?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.16,0:12:08.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn, it's poison mist!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.38,0:12:11.38,Default,,0,0,0,,A magic giant...!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.33,0:12:16.98,Default,,0,0,0,,It hurts...I can't breathe.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.22,0:12:25.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Opal!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.77,0:12:59.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Sapphire, oh, please wake up!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.85,0:13:01.49,Default,,0,0,0,,If Opal hadn't brought her back,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.51,0:13:04.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Sapphire would be in the hands of the X-Gang right now...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.81,0:13:07.78,Default,,0,0,0,,You must be so worried, but what did the doctor say?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.78,0:13:11.57,Default,,0,0,0,,He said it's a poison never seen in this kingdom, so there is no known cure...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.66,0:13:15.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Sapphire, if only I could take your place...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.36,0:13:18.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Sapphire, please wake up...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.37,0:13:24.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Your Majesty, I brought a fortune teller hoping he might be of some help.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.89,0:13:27.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Now then, Princess Sapphire's fate...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.84,0:13:30.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Can that fortune-telling really tell us what lies ahead for Sapphire?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.45,0:13:32.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.69,0:13:33.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, everyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.56,0:13:37.76,Default,,0,0,0,,He is waiting in the hall, so please come hear his prophecy.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.81,0:13:47.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Everyone has gathered, I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.58,0:13:49.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Well then, let us begin.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.42,0:13:57.78,Default,,0,0,0,,How dreadful!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.51,0:14:07.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, how tragic...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.73,0:14:10.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Tomorrow night, this castle will be shrouded in a black mist.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.12,0:14:16.54,Default,,0,0,0,,In that fog, you will hear the Phantom Giant approaching.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.22,0:14:19.23,Default,,0,0,0,,And so, Sapphire...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.63,0:14:23.93,Default,,0,0,0,,will be taken by the Phantom Giant. No one can stop it.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.05,0:14:26.90,Default,,0,0,0,,If you resist, you will meet your doom.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.10,0:14:28.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, how terrible...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.61,0:14:30.69,Default,,0,0,0,,My Queen, what is the matter?!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.72,0:14:34.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Everyone! Do not block the Phantom Giant's path!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.16,0:14:37.19,Default,,0,0,0,,What a tragic fate!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.64,0:14:40.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Princess Sapphire falls into evil hands while still asleep!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.60,0:14:56.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Sapphire!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.37,0:15:01.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Franz, it's a secret that Sapphire moved into this room.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.31,0:15:01.97,Default,,0,0,0,,A secret?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.00,0:15:04.36,Default,,0,0,0,,So Sapphire's room will stay empty?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.38,0:15:06.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Look, over there!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.41,0:15:10.13,Default,,0,0,0,,I will stand in for Sapphire.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.64,0:15:11.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Your Majesty!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.20,0:15:14.57,Default,,0,0,0,,I tried my best to stop her, but she wouldn't listen.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.59,0:15:16.20,Default,,0,0,0,,So I called Franz.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.04,0:15:19.32,Default,,0,0,0,,You want me to fight the Phantom Giant?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.92,0:15:20.37,Default,,0,0,0,,All right!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.39,0:15:21.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Actually...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.29,0:15:24.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Franz, I want you to go to X's outer castle.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.94,0:15:28.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Rumor has it the giant is a demon guarding the fortress.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.43,0:15:30.88,Default,,0,0,0,,If we bring down the castle, perhaps the black fog will...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.23,0:15:32.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Leave it to me, Your Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.89,0:15:36.38,Default,,0,0,0,,I will surely crush that cursed tower with my own strength.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.12,0:15:40.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Sapphire, I would go anywhere to protect you.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.42,0:15:42.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Even through the gates of hell from which there is no return.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.84,0:15:45.01,Default,,0,0,0,,So stay strong and wait for me, Sapphire.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.90,0:15:49.34,Default,,0,0,0,,I am taking my leave now, Your Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.18,0:15:56.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Be careful, Prince Franz.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.60,0:16:37.10,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}It's night. Night has come.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.96,0:16:56.88,Default,,0,0,0,,The giant has appeared!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.40,0:17:04.64,Default,,0,0,0,,That sounded like a scream...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.00,0:17:18.97,Default,,0,0,0,,The Phantom Giant...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.00,0:17:20.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Just as foretold, the giant has come!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.70,0:17:41.11,Default,,0,0,0,,No one will get in our way now!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.70,0:17:48.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, my lovely crows, carry her carefully!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.00,0:17:54.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Sapphire, you're awake.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.15,0:17:56.15,Default,,0,0,0,,What on earth happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.72,0:17:59.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Isn't this Mother's room?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.90,0:18:02.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, there are complicated circumstances.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.06,0:18:03.91,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.39,0:18:07.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Mother!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.62,0:18:08.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Mother!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.94,0:18:10.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Mother!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.38,0:18:12.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Mother!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.12,0:18:14.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Mother...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.71,0:18:19.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Just as the fortune foretold, a Phantom Giant carried her off.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.22,0:18:20.66,Default,,0,0,0,,A phantom giant?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.50,0:18:22.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Sapphire,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.27,0:18:24.30,Default,,0,0,0,,you're supposed to be in bed!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.64,0:18:26.32,Default,,0,0,0,,That's right... as if I could just give up!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.41,0:18:27.86,Default,,0,0,0,,You were hit by poison, after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.96,0:18:29.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn you X. How dare you take Mother.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.62,0:18:31.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Look at you, you need to stay in bed.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.70,0:18:36.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't be reckless, Sapphire is sick!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.19,0:18:38.64,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm not Sapphire anymore!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.66,0:18:39.71,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm the Ribbon Knight!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.81,0:18:41.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's go, Tink!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.60,0:18:45.67,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Damn you, X... Just you wait!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.96,0:18:47.30,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I will save you, Mother... I promise!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.62,0:19:01.80,Default,,0,0,0,,It's just those two, as expected.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.83,0:19:16.11,Default,,0,0,0,,It burns! I can't see...!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.30,0:19:24.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Lord X, here is what was promised...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.72,0:19:26.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Good work.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.14,0:19:31.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Well done.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.75,0:19:33.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Now I have nothing left to fear.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.81,0:19:35.13,Default,,0,0,0,,This is Sapphire.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.46,0:19:38.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Isn't this the Queen of Silverland?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.29,0:19:40.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn it!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.70,0:19:43.69,Default,,0,0,0,,She shielded her daughter and took her place!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.71,0:19:44.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Curse it!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.92,0:19:48.85,Default,,0,0,0,,What's that bell...?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.28,0:19:50.92,Default,,0,0,0,,An intruder! Seize them!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.80,0:20:05.24,Default,,0,0,0,,It's Prince Franz!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.50,0:20:09.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Goldland remnants, drop your swords!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.88,0:20:12.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Slaves, back to your cells!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.42,0:20:15.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Unless you want the Queen to die!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.47,0:20:19.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Prince Franz! Drop your sword!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.03,0:20:24.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Or do you not care what happens to the queen of a neighboring kingdom?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.08,0:20:25.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Cowards!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.01,0:20:27.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Using a hostage!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.25,0:20:32.26,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll give you until the count of ten!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.72,0:20:34.05,Default,,0,0,0,,One!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.38,0:20:38.97,Default,,0,0,0,,That's...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.88,0:20:40.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Mother!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.02,0:20:43.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Five!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.28,0:20:45.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Six!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.81,0:20:52.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Seven!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.07,0:20:58.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Eight!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.66,0:21:04.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Prepare yourself!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.31,0:21:05.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait, stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.90,0:21:09.16,Default,,0,0,0,,That's Prince Franz.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.88,0:21:13.05,Default,,0,0,0,,That's a good prince.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.26,0:21:13.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Now,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.99,0:21:16.71,Default,,0,0,0,,to make an example of him, run your sword through his chest.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.73,0:21:17.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Prince Franz!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.98,0:21:23.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Ribbon Knight!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.06,0:21:24.62,Default,,0,0,0,,What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.26,0:21:26.29,Default,,0,0,0,,You stupid bad guy!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.00,0:21:28.12,Default,,0,0,0,,You little pipsqueak!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.57,0:21:29.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Tink! Look out!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.78,0:21:34.00,Default,,0,0,0,,As if something like that would throw me off!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.02,0:21:37.27,Default,,0,0,0,,You slippery little wretch,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.30,0:21:38.38,Default,,0,0,0,,die!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.06,0:21:46.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Franz take my sword!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.88,0:21:47.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Ribbon Knight!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.08,0:21:49.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's go, X!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.75,0:21:51.96,Default,,0,0,0,,We've been interrupted! Fall back for now!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.98,0:21:53.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait, X!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.20,0:21:54.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Curse you, this castle is lost!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.79,0:21:56.48,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll make sure to pay you back for this!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.49,0:21:57.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.38,0:21:58.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Impudent prince,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.69,0:22:01.52,Default,,0,0,0,,perish along with this castle!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:02.67,0:22:03.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn it! He got away!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.67,0:22:07.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Franz, are you all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:08.16,0:22:10.00,Default,,0,0,0,,X escaped, but I'm fine!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:15.16,0:22:16.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Look out! Franz, run!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:16.92,0:22:18.70,Default,,0,0,0,,The castle is collapsing!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:42.67,0:22:46.84,Default,,0,0,0,,It's collapsing behind us! Move, fast!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:26.16,0:23:26.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn X!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:27.00,0:23:28.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Using a phantom giant transformed from crows,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:28.77,0:23:31.06,Default,,0,0,0,,all because he wanted slaves to build his castle!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:31.51,0:23:33.84,Default,,0,0,0,,So that's why he was kidnapping the townspeople!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:34.16,0:23:36.32,Default,,0,0,0,,X's scheme is completely ruined!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:36.34,0:23:37.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Serves him right!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:40.08,0:23:41.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Where is the Ribbon Knight off to?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:41.26,0:23:42.99,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm worried about X getting away!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:43.37,0:23:45.47,Default,,0,0,0,,There's no telling what trick he'll pull next!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:45.49,0:23:46.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Just be careful!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:47.59,0:23:48.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you, Ribbon Knight!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:48.87,0:23:49.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Until we meet again!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:51.27,0:23:52.90,Default,,0,0,0,,- Goodbye!\N- Thank you, Prince Franz.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:59.85,0:24:02.83,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}You think you've thwarted my plans, but think again.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:03.53,0:24:07.08,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}X saves the best for last.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:09.84,0:24:13.89,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Next time, I'll destroy Silverland for sure.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:14.37,0:24:15.48,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Mark my words!{\i0}
